Package: carbonite
Title: Components from the 'Carbon Design System' for 'shiny'
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Evan", "Brand", , "etbrand@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre", "cph")),
    person("IBM Corp.", role = "cph",
           comment = "'Carbon Design System' web components, styles and icons; IBM Plex fonts"),
    person("Google LLC", role = "cph", comment = "'Lit' library"),
    person("Floating UI contributors", role = "cph", comment = "'Floating UI' library"),
    person("OpenJS Foundation and other contributors", role = "cph", comment = "'lodash' library"),
    person("Gregory", "Petrosyan", role = "cph", comment = "'flatpickr' library"),
    person("Adobe", role = "cph", comment = "'@internationalized/number' library")
  )
Description: Build 'shiny' apps with the 'Carbon Design System'
    <https://carbondesignsystem.com/>. Wraps IBM's '@carbon/web-components'
    as 'shiny' inputs, outputs and layouts, including buttons, text, date
    and time inputs, selects, sliders, data tables with sorting, selection,
    pagination and expandable rows, modals, notifications, menus, tabs,
    tiles and an application shell with side navigation.
